# Milestone: v0.14.0-refoundation
# Covers: two strands dying on an uncaught throw in one pump.  vm->last_error
#         is one buffer, so before the fix the detached strand's message was
#         what the awaited strand's caller read: `{ throw "A" } , throw "B"`
#         reported "A" twice and lost "B" entirely.  A strand nobody awaits
#         reports through the diag hook; the awaited strand's message is the
#         one its caller is handed, and the two must not be the same text
#         unless the two throws were.
{ throw "A" } , throw "B"
[00000000] !!! "A"
[00000000] !!! "B"
